{"id":"n40665-2-6","stage":4,"title":"꼬이다 · 扭曲","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40665-2-6-1","ko":"도움 같은 건 필요 없어요.","zh":"我不需要什么帮助。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도움","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"필요","meaning":"必要，需要","explanation":"필요：必要，需要。","readings":[{"term":"필요","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72405","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필요","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8d901cc28dffe7ee","term":"도움","zh":"帮助，帮忙，援助","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3","entryId":"64542","definition":"帮扶他人的事宜。","pronunciation":["도움"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"那样的，类似的","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示与某物属于近似的种类。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"3ceb8b2c14a13750","term":"필요","zh":"必要，需要","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3","entryId":"72405","definition":"必须得有。","pronunciation":["피료"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b04bc012351154abe29.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40665-2-6-2","ko":"넌 어린애가 왜 벌써부터 그렇게 꼬였니?","zh":"你还是个孩子，怎么就这么别扭呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"어린애가","meaning":"幼稚，水平差；孩子，小孩","explanation":"어리다：幼稚，水平差；애：孩子，小孩；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"},{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"4","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린애가","audio":"/audio/ee819d91291511dd9a86.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써부터","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써부터","audio":"/audio/23ff8caf94dc3d12e2b1.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"꼬였니?","meaning":"扭曲","explanation":"꼬이다：扭曲；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"꼬이다","audio":"/audio/ad7c2f23abc7ed80c0a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40665","senseId":"2","lemma":"꼬이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼬였니","audio":"/audio/89d9e99274379734dc64.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"幼稚，水平差","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"缺乏思考或缺少经验或水平低。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"ad7c2f23abc7ed80","term":"꼬이다","zh":"扭曲","audio":"/audio/ad7c2f23abc7ed80c0a7.mp3","entryId":"40665","definition":"心情不顺或性格别扭。","pronunciation":["꼬이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1118b2edafe2e5cae392.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.677,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40665","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4023,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你还是个孩子，怎么就这么别扭呢？","我不需要什么帮助。","你什么时候把围巾织了这么长？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不需要什么帮助。","你什么时候把围巾织了这么长？","你还是个孩子，怎么就这么别扭呢？"],"answer":2}]}
